; tests/truth-arrival-band.fk — boolean, fuzzy, and the escape from both.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/offer-ack-core.fk form-stdlib/truth-arrival.fk
;
; Band verdict 11111111111111 when, on Go / Rust / TypeScript / fkwu:
;   the boolean sub-lattice {0,1} reproduces the classical and/or/not
;     tables in full — all eight rows walked, not claimed              ->              1
;   fuzzy and is min: and(0.7, 0.3) = 0.3                              ->             10
;   fuzzy or is max:  or (0.7, 0.3) = 0.7                              ->            100
;   de Morgan survives the interval, at three sample pairs             ->           1000
;   excluded middle HOLDS in boolean                                   ->          10000
;   excluded middle fails BY DEGREE in fuzzy: or(0.5, not 0.5) = 0.5   ->         100000
;     — still a value, just not the top one
;   excluded middle fails BY ABSENCE with nothing: or(n, not n) has
;     no value at all — a different death, not a weaker truth          ->        1000000
;   and(false, nothing) = false — ANSWERABLE WITHOUT WAITING           ->       10000000
;   and(true,  nothing) = nothing — this one waits                  ->      100000000
;   or (true,  nothing) = true, while or(false, nothing) = nothing     ->     1000000000
;   and(0.3, nothing) = nothing — a degree does not absorb; only the
;     poles do, so the absorbing power is boolean, not fuzzy           ->    10000000000
;   nothing is NO degree in disguise: for every mu across the interval
;     and(true, mu) is known, while and(true, nothing) is not          ->   100000000000
;   THE ESCAPE — an answer known now, on an input that never arrives:
;     and(false, never) = false. Neither boolean nor fuzzy can say it,
;     because both demand a total valuation before they will speak     ->  1000000000000
;   and it is safe to finish early: truth never un-resolves (a time
;     sweep, both for a signal that arrives and one that never does),
;     plus the merge — poles land on axiom-5's 0/1 arms, absence on
;     nothing, and the fuzzy interior has no terminal arm at all, so
;     it travels as a NODE                                          -> 10000000000000

(do
    (ta-check))
